          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "The Bug Beats are in the garden today playing their favorite tunes for all to hear. While they listen to the lovely music, Greta and Sunny learn all about purple fruits and veggies: eggplants (or aubergines!), beets, blackberries, and more. Spider, Worm and Butterfly tell the story of “Grape, the Superhero”, they learn how to make a grape Superfood snack, and they close out their rhythmic day with a game of “Purple or Not Purple.”&nbsp;",
